      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need a getSubscriptionIds here as well? Generally methods on a builder class should correspond 1:1 with methods on the built classs.\n\nIn this case NetworkRequest.Builder#setSubscriptionIds sets the subscription IDs within the capabilities, but once the object is built, there\u0027s on way to fetch those capabilities any more. Looks like there is a NetworkCapabilities#getSubscriptionIds, but it\u0027s @SystemApi, not public.\n\nShould we make it public? Or is this intentional? Perhaps because the subscription IDs are redacted? (Are they redacted?)",
